        "Content": "<ul><li> Handsome double fronted red brick family home.</li><li> South facing private mature garden.</li><li> Off street parking for multiple cars.</li><li> Side access.</li><li> Luxurious master suite with walk-in wardrobe.</li><li> Many original features, including fireplaces, ceiling coving, doors.</li><li> Superb location beside many sought after schools.</li><li> Close to a choice of public transport links.</li><li> Tremendous potential to extend to the rear (stpp)</ul>"
